scn 1
# Passing within a small click (2026-11-16; tools/legion_overtake_test.py), the owner's case:
# a loose column of 14 two abreast, about 11 cells across and 27 deep, Aramon Knights
# (fast 3x3, speed 2.9) and Swordsmen (slow 2x2, 1.10) mixed, sent with ONE right-click to one
# point about 1000 px from the click's centre, as a player sends a mixed selection. Asset-free.
# Open field, move order.
name overtake-click-loose-1000
ticks 3000
players 1
weapons off
map flat 128 200
type slow mover 2 2500 1 1.10
type fast mover 3 2500 1 2.9
group S0 0 slow 1 cells 58,70
group F1 0 fast 1 cells 63,70
group F2 0 fast 1 cells 57,74
group S3 0 slow 1 cells 62,74
group S4 0 slow 1 cells 59,78
group F5 0 fast 1 cells 64,78
group F6 0 fast 1 cells 56,82
group S7 0 slow 1 cells 61,82
group S8 0 slow 1 cells 58,86
group F9 0 fast 1 cells 63,86
group F10 0 fast 1 cells 57,90
group S11 0 slow 1 cells 62,90
group S12 0 slow 1 cells 59,94
group F13 0 fast 1 cells 64,94
at 5 move S0,F1,F2,S3,S4,F5,F6,S7,S8,F9,F10,S11,S12,F13 60 20
